    "sections": {
        "description": "Truelove is a beautiful and elegant WordPress wedding theme crafted for couples, engagements, weddings, and special occasions. This responsive and SEO-friendly theme comes with multiple layout options including one-column, two-columns, and right sidebar to perfectly showcase your story. It features custom header and background, featured images, threaded comments, and built-in customizer for easy customization. With support for Contact Form 7, you can create RSVP forms or guest message sections effortlessly. Truelove is fully translation-ready and works flawlessly across all browsers and devices, making it an ideal choice for wedding websites, blogs, event invitations, or romantic photography showcases."
    },
